{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Bumpy Ride</strong> is <i>Cosmoporium Games</i>' breakout title! In this train-driving exploration game, you'll be tasked with managing a small railroad all alone. Drive the train, hire your crew, and take passengers where they want to go! Explore and reveal new areas on your map, spurred on by passengers' requests to go to places you <i>might not recognize</i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features include: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A little locomotive with customizable paint job &amp; flags</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable new train cars, such as a first class car or a gondola car for freight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A level-up system tied to unlocking new upgrades, staff, and skins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An expansive world, with many classic American-inspired vistas ready to be explored!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full day/night cycle &amp; day-based progression</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope you'll join us for our journey in <strong>A Bumpy Ride</strong>!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3056840?t=1771037575","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3056840?t=1771037575","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056840/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771037575","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056840/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771037575","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3544800,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Bumpy Ride</strong> is <i>Cosmoporium Games</i>' breakout title! In this train-driving exploration game, you'll be tasked with managing a small railroad all alone. Drive the train, hire your crew, and take passengers where they want to go! Explore and reveal new areas on your map, spurred on by passengers' requests to go to places you <i>might not recognize</i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features include: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A little locomotive with customizable paint job &amp; flags</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable new train cars, such as a first class car or a gondola car for freight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A level-up system tied to unlocking new upgrades, staff, and skins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An expansive world, with many classic American-inspired vistas ready to be explored!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full day/night cycle &amp; day-based progression</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope you'll join us for our journey in <strong>A Bumpy Ride</strong>!</p>","developers":["Cosmoporium Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056840/header.jpg?t=1771037575","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3056840/2137439459/a9ddd80e14d36d84d36924e059b2b57c39d631bd/1771036603/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771037574","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3056840/2137439459/a9ddd80e14d36d84d36924e059b2b57c39d631bd/1771036603/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771037574","